#!RuleTest
#test CT-RUN-1 expect=violation domain=VS
#note CQ1 (a) — a SEND Trial Summary has no TSVCDREF/TSVCDVER; it states its CT version as the SNDCTVER row's TSVAL ("SEND CT 2024-09-27", the P0-measured spelling). A sendig run takes sendct-2024-09-27 from it, and only that (CQ2 (a): no sdtmct companion — the store holds none).
#run-product sendig/3-1-1
#ct-available sendct-2024-09-27
#expect-ct-mismatch "CT taken from the Trial Summary: sendct-2024-09-27 (TSPARMCD \"SNDCTVER\", TSVAL \"SEND CT 2024-09-27\")"
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset VS
col VSSTAT type=Char
---
BOGUS
---

dataset TS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
---
S1 | SNDIGVER | SEND Implementation Guide Version 3.1.1
S1 | SNDCTVER | SEND CT 2024-09-27
---
